Package: CorporateDown
Title: Apply a Corporate Design to All 'ggplot2' Figures
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Orlando", "Willig", email = "orlando.willig@efk.admin.ch",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Define a corporate design once (colours, typography, sizes and
    logo) as a declarative YAML file and have all subsequent 'ggplot2'
    figures follow it automatically. A single call to
    'set_corporate_design()' registers a matching theme, default colour and
    fill scales, geom defaults and fonts, so ordinary 'ggplot2' code renders
    in the corporate design without repeating theme or scale calls. Ships
    with the design of the Swiss Federal Audit Office (EFK) as a reference.
